      "styles" : {
        "code" : true
      }
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : " root bean with its spec-time descriptor and default form shipped verbatim, email-format and default-true validation, and an observer sheet that lists all suppliers sorted by name. Builds the Suppliers screen from the spec mock: a table that greys out inactive rows and a side panel holding the default form. It is registered under Procurement › Suppliers, in three tasks."
    } ]
